      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "TriggerFish Scene Pack 4 smoke test\n\nFour Fundamental oscillators feed the four source inputs. Scene Pack compacts every connected mono or polyphonic channel into one polyphonic output, which feeds Room Reverb.\n\nThe reverb room plan shows four numbered amber sources. Drag them to place each oscillator independently; disconnect a Scene Pack input and its marker disappears. Feed another Scene Pack's poly output into one input to exercise the eight-source path. Start with monitor volume low."
      },
